  {
    "id": "a7fa93d9-bffa-5c8a-87d7-f8e57fce6488",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:luminous-sprite",
    "name": "Luminous Sprite",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "ancestry-guide"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You glow with magical luminance. You naturally shed light as a "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "e58cead6-6304-5f35-8f34-cfa035d6fd1f"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "; this light has the evocation, light, and primal traits. You can extinguish, rekindle, or change the color of this light using a single action, which has the concentrate trait."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.LU4i3qXtyzeTGWZQ"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "dd8ed85b-b70c-5816-8ddc-31590346f8d5"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "a74c4543-71f5-580c-bf53-31c8db468171",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:melixie",
    "name": "Melixie",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "ancestry-guide"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have the features of a bee, butterfly, or other insect that loves sweets. You can ask questions of and receive answers from arthropods (insects, spiders, scorpions, crabs, and similar invertebrate animals), as well as use Diplomacy to Make an Impression on and Request things of them. Most bees, butterflies, moths, and beetles have an "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "44d39747-aad3-5b73-a493-af78cda98eef"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ef3f130c-50e8-51b3-be54-5d0d0ecbc970"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " starting attitude toward you and give you time to make your case, though other arthropods react to you like any other adventurer."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.TYvzNoL5ldmB5F76"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "dd8ed85b-b70c-5816-8ddc-31590346f8d5"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "f28d0d4e-f6b8-578f-b657-183e9477eaf4",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:murkeyed-azarketi",
    "name": "Murkeyed Azarketi",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "ancestry-guide"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You live in murky waters and have grown accustomed to life in a low-visibility environment. You need only a successful "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "flat",
            "dc": 3
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " when targeting a concealed creature and a successful "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "flat",
            "dc": 9
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " when targeting a hidden creature."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.MtH5bq0MhaMQbJEL"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
    "id": "0b5d540c-cb3f-5289-90bc-befc873edf2d",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:mutated-fleshwarp",
    "name": "Mutated Fleshwarp",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "ancestry-guide"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Transformed by uncontrolled magic, you originated in a the Mana Wastes or another region similarly devastated by uncontrolled magic. Due to your toughened or redundant organs, the DC for your checks to recover from persistent bleed damage is 10 instead of 15, and it's reduced to "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "flat",
            "dc": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " instead of 10 if you have particularly effective assistance recovering from the persistent damage."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.CCwTBSNTw0caN1jd"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "e2101776-f83a-5828-b46a-ffd770e095d1"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "c3157b3b-34a6-51cb-a42f-4a9eda8390a2",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:naari",
    "name": "Naari",
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["naari"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "ancestry-guide"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You descend from fire elementals or bear the mark of the Inner Spheres, and your features illustrate the influence that elemental fire has over you. You gain the naari trait, in addition to the traits from your ancestry. You gain resistance to fire equal to half your level (minimum 1), and you treat environmental heat effects as if they were one step less severe (incredible heat becomes extreme, extreme heat becomes severe, and so on). You can choose from naari feats and feats from your ancestry whenever you gain an ancestry feat."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "Resistance",
        "type": ["fire"],
        "value": "max(1, floor(@level / 2))"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.Svk2CHwvurK1QQhD"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
    "id": "439c787f-b8e0-5913-ad0d-0296de4bdce8",
    "pack": "ancestry-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:nightglider-strix",
